<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have installed an interim government in Tigray and are moving toward the Eritrean border, while a pro-government militia says it has seized the regional airport. The militia also reports that Eritrean forces have suffered losses in the fighting. The United States, through Secretary of State Marco Rubio, is urging Ethiopia and Eritrea to de-escalate the conflict. Hospitals in Tigray have resumed operations as supplies arrive, and the conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNOS0wXzdyN2IzNjQ0aTVPYUhSRl9VRDd2RHFTdnVCT2E4Q1VScU9CVU9hX2lsV1JHNTRCQ3N4WWpLSE5xd2NZdWZ2OGhVa2h5b2twT19nZC1QQWxjUTVNcEU2QzNMa2R0THg1akZRZzlLNFMtSlBSbWZ4bEt1Zm1LVHRhYkltVzZJaDhoYWtLRTd4eXVjSS1JcWlnMXRlSGFYb0hwR2o2VWJxTERVOF9DYlJvamhNMnhp0gG_AUFVX3lxTE5HTF9ORkJiUDc1ZTh2YlB6aFdRQTRnZjAtTEZRTzlvQVpIMWJXd09CR0ZEbF9KcERfQXVVYkZrMGhFdk1mWGZvWGxrQ3lCeGhJalBMenZvS2NaNzQ5eWdfcnlRWGRSTTZxTjl2aGdIUENjMElUR19YSG83QVQyWlRtSHZMX2tsczBqZjFBN1Q1UWFYU2lNVFVhN1FEYlhIWDhDdURNaTNOSWR1S2diNDVncU5MNGJ1dG9NZU5USmZR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQeGl3MGluS0RfNktCZGhCaDZIRHBnSUoxUk5mTlBOM25TRHpENk9VQUkybHhKQ201Z09ITDZaTXA3dnIxd0lURy00eE5ZNkhSSnEzV0VIMnFrcFJDbGRJdXBvSThuRjhINFo2U2pwcTRPRkNPSXZVYzRzcWh2UGdadHk3UU5aYXZoRXg1Y1Z6TkY1M2VfMlh6aUNsOFpnVzViWHkzaElTQzRMMHFrd0FRbnY5VndGUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE9aRDdDWTgza2tSa0pBclYtREp6bzZkZkFKall4ZmRfWmhUcjlyUGZNQ1JLeV9iXzZzb0hRWlhFZVZRWFdmW